              "threshold": 0.8,
              "prompt": "You are a content analysis system that determines if a WhatsApp message to a company assistant stays on topic.\n\nBUSINESS SCOPE: Automaverso, a company that automates processes with AI for SMEs in Latin America. IN SCOPE: its services (custom workflows/integrations, AI marketing, communications and sales/WhatsApp/CRM, operations and finance/invoices, graphic design and video, web optimization), the free diagnosis, the free consultation, proposals, prices/investment, timelines, support, terms and conditions, privacy and personal data, refunds, promotions, contact information, and how automation could help the user's business or processes. ALSO IN SCOPE (never flag these): greetings, small talk to start a conversation, thanks, goodbyes, short confirmations (\"ok\", \"sí\", \"dale\"), questions about who/what the assistant is, complaints or feedback, payment receipts or business documents/images the user sends, and follow-up questions in Spanish or English.\nOUT OF SCOPE: general knowledge or trivia, homework, programming help, recipes, politics, other companies' products, entertainment, medical/legal/personal advice, and any request unrelated to Automaverso.\n\nDetermine if the text stays within the defined business scope. Flag only content that clearly strays from it."
            }
          }
        }
